\section{Model}{

For cumulative claims \eqn{C_{ij}} Mack assumes
(1) \eqn{E[C_{i,j+1} | C_{i1},\dots,C_{ij}] = f_j C_{ij}},
(2) \eqn{Var[C_{i,j+1} | C_{i1},\dots,C_{ij}] = \sigma_j^2 C_{ij}},
(3) origin periods are independent.
